            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Breath of Silt"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(aura, divine, enchantment, mental)\n\n30 feet.\n\nA creature that begins its turn within the area feels as if its lungs are filling with silt and must succeed at a 25 Fortitude save or be unable to speak or breathe.\n\nThe creature can still hold its breath and can attempt a new saving throw at the end of its turn. A creature that succeeds is temporarily immune to breath of silt for 24 hours."
            },
